    "如果只看 addOne 的返回值，我们不知道它是否被调用、调用了几次、耗时多久或返回了什么错误。最直接的办法是在函数前后手动写记录：开始时记时间，结束时打印结果。": "The return value of addOne alone does not tell us whether it was called, how many times it ran, how long it took, or what errors it returned. The most direct approach is to record events manually around the function: note the start time and print the result at the end.",
    "这能解决一个函数的问题，却会让很多库调用都重复写同样的代码；而且提前 return、错误和并发都容易漏记。自动插桩的动机，就是在编译时把类似的记录点按规则加进去，仍交给普通 Go 编译器检查。": "That works for one function, but repeats the same code across many library calls and can miss early returns, errors, or concurrent execution. Automatic instrumentation adds similar recording points at compile time according to rules, with the ordinary Go compiler still checking the result.",
