    "context.Context 是标准库接口，用来传取消信号、deadline 和请求范围的值；Go 不会因 go f() 自动复制它。需要把 ctx 作为参数传给子函数或任务。": "context.Context is a standard library interface carrying cancellation signals, deadlines, and request-scoped values. Go does not copy it automatically when you write go f(); pass ctx as an argument to child functions or tasks.",
    "LoongSuite 的 CallContext 是插桩 hook 用来读写目标函数参数、返回值和共享数据的工具接口；它不等于 context.Context，也不能替代 context 的取消或传播。GLS 同样是工具/runtime 的额外机制，不是 Go 原生自动 context。": "LoongSuite's CallContext is a tool interface that instrumentation hooks use to read and write a target function's parameters, return values, and shared data. It is not context.Context and does not replace context cancellation or propagation. GLS is likewise an extra tool/runtime mechanism, not native automatic Go context.",
