    "显式传递保留取消、deadline 和 SpanContext；Background 会丢父链，全局变量又会造成并发串链和生命周期问题。": "Explicit passing preserves cancellation, deadlines, and SpanContext. Background loses the parent chain, while a global variable risks mixing concurrent traces and creating lifecycle problems.",
    "某类型只有指针 receiver 的方法，为什么值 T 作为接口参数可能编译失败？": "If a type has a method only on a pointer receiver, why might passing a value T as an interface fail to compile?",
