    "指针和值的方法集不同，接口赋值在编译期检查；第二项混淆了自动取址场景，第三项错误地把静态类型检查归为反射。": "Pointer and value types have different method sets, and interface assignment is checked at compile time. The second option confuses this with automatic address-taking; the third incorrectly treats static type checking as reflection.",
